{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46844","headline":"寄郑谷郎中 · 齐己","name":"寄郑谷郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国谁传消息过，醉眠醒坐对嵯峨。\n身离道士衣裳少，笔荅禅师句偈多。\n南岸郡钟凉度枕，西斋竹露冷沾莎。\n还应笑我降心外，惹得诗魔助佛魔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}